              "raw_text": "HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES. Monday, December 4, 1865. This being the day prescribed by the Consti- tution for the meeting of Congress, the mem- bers of the House of Representatives assembled in their Hall, aud at twelve o'clock, m., were called to order by Hon. Edward McPherson, Clerk' of the last House of Representatives. OllGANIZATION OF THE HOUSE.",
              "raw_sha256": "3c5d292b3b691dc82d4232da79bab3d1dd4ffce1943ab1e7a0c042e1eabbaa38",
