              "item_identifier": "congressionalg7391unit",
              "scan_leaf": 117,
              "raw_text": "The CLERK said: The hour having arrived for the meeting of the Thii'ty-Ninth Congress, the Clerk of the last House of Representatives will proceed, as required by law, to read by States the roll of members-elect. Gentlemen are requested to respond as their names are called.",
